{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "articleId": "684702047d14",
  "publishedAt": "2026-10-05T13:00:00Z",
  "sourceUrl": "https://blog.cloudflare.com/birthday-week-2026-wrap-up/",
  "sourceTitle": "Everything we launched during Birthday Week 2026",
  "sourceBodyHash": "d3de58747f5f542a53cfa7fe3971c77a93f6eae32d035dd52f0188d882735930",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "partial",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "groq",
  "requestedModel": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b",
  "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-05T14:12:32.480094Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-06T01:22:22.672266Z",
  "totalBlocks": 109,
  "translatedBlocks": 69,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a72b7a22b7a20fb2",
      "translationZh": "我们上周通过分享我们如何为今天的世界构建更好的互联网来庆祝我们的第16个生日。正如Matthew和Michelle在今年的创始人信中所反映的，今年见证了互联网历史上一些最具影响力的变化。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0778177a4336828b",
      "translationZh": "首次，自动化流量超过了人类活动。AI 正在以前所未有的方式赋能人们进行构建，导致互联网在规模上实现巨大增长，并释放出更多的雄心和创造力。正如我们所见证的，代理驱动的推荐对消费者选择的影响，我们意识到需要一种新方法，为新企业的成功创造空间。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc9236efc5addec9",
      "translationZh": "生日周的每一天都探讨了我们帮助构建互联网未来的不同方式。我们在星期一通过加强对开源的承诺来拉开序幕。星期二聚焦于应用安全和后量子转型。星期三，我们探讨了面向代理互联网的新经济模型。星期四，我们通过新增用于数据分析、存储、AI 和代理开发的工具，扩展了开发者平台。最后，我们通过推出让 Cloudflare 更快速、更易操作且对每个人更具可访问性的功能来结束这一周。作为生日周的特别后续，我们在宣布目标要招聘 1,111 名实习生一年后，分享了实习项目的更新。实习生直接参与了本周推出的许多项目，包括 EmDash、后量子可视化、CryptoLabe 和受保护的快速隧道。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b80c070c18a16c0",
      "translationZh": "我们本周发布了 46 条公告。如果您有遗漏，以下是我们在 2026 年生日周期间宣布的所有内容的完整列表。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2fea7b1dfd39d55e",
      "translationZh": "星期一，9月28日 - 对开源的承诺",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8504994e16d81c62",
      "translationZh": "我们宣布了新的 CLI，该 CLI 伴随我们用于生成它的流水线以及我们的 SDK 和文档一起发布。我们分享了我们如何构建以在使用 Cloudflare 时支持代理和开发者——同时也支持您所依赖的项目。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e61065c0f9b59ff2",
      "translationZh": "介绍 cf：面向整个 Cloudflare API 的代理 CLI",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "219ee2cc9b03afaa",
      "translationZh": "新的 cf CLI 镜像了 Cloudflare API，采用 JSON-first 输出和类型化配置，为人们和代理提供了一致的命令行界面。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23d182755f85da93",
      "translationZh": "介绍 Forge：用于生成 SDK、CLI、文档等的开源流水线",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc02428f0cdc1f93",
      "translationZh": "Forge 是一个可插拔的开源流水线，在 CI 中运行，直接从 API 定义生成 SDK、CLI、文档和其他接口。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd1dbf5ef22b20e3",
      "translationZh": "介绍 EmDash —— 解决插件安全问题的 WordPress 精神继承者",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da7e627563333976",
      "translationZh": "EmDash 是一个基于 Astro 的开源无服务器 CMS，在具有明确批准功能的隔离 Worker 沙箱中运行插件。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85c486766846f644",
      "translationZh": "VoidZero 在 Cloudflare 工作四个月：让所有人和代理都能更快地使用开源 JavaScript 工具链",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49bff6857d122dd2",
      "translationZh": "自加入 Cloudflare 以来，VoidZero 在 Vite 生态系统中交付了超过 80 个版本，其之前的商业 Void 平台将变为完全开源。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d37ddcbef60b4a4",
      "translationZh": "由 Vite 驱动的 Next.js 应用：介绍 Vinext 1.0",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "657b609db59a4be7",
      "translationZh": "Vinext 1.0 将 AI 构建的实验转化为在 Vite 上运行 Next.js 应用的生产就绪、便携方式。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de57368a4c5eac9c",
      "translationZh": "通往代理浏览器之路：Kitesurf 更新",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0e52b095b844b8c",
      "translationZh": "Kitesurf，我们基于 Workers 的代理浏览器，添加了 WebMCP 支持、更快的 DOM 操作、更广泛的 Web 兼容性以及基于终端的渲染。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63d2a5d1f037bdaf",
      "translationZh": "网页有多快？使用 BEACON 探索数十亿真实用户测量数据",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5fe32ec2d9d09ef1",
      "translationZh": "BEACON 将来自 10,000 个主要网站的数十亿条匿名真实用户性能测量数据作为公共 BigQuery 数据集提供。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd395820acf73002",
      "translationZh": "通过新的 Emscripten 目标为 wasm-bindgen 在 Workers 中支持原生 Rust",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b670469743794b20",
      "translationZh": "实验性 Emscripten 目标支持使开发者能够将更多原生 Rust 库和应用（包括朝着 Tokio 支持的进展）带到 Workers。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe1c3cd11be468eb",
      "translationZh": "介绍 The Cold Start：在 Cloudflare Connect 现场推介您的初创公司",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe3e690595cd2738",
      "translationZh": "The Cold Start 为五家早期公司提供在 Cloudflare Connect 现场推介的机会，并竞争资源以助其成长。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a408cb4109bb8a28",
      "translationZh": "星期二，9月29日 - 帮助保护代理互联网",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92b1558b78a7ae56",
      "translationZh": "技术进步正在迅速改变我们对应用安全的思考方式。我们宣布了成为证书颁发机构的意图，以及我们如何为后量子时代准备基础互联网密码学，并调整应用安全以抵御AI驱动的攻击。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a16a9812a6c3bd6",
      "translationZh": "为整个互联网构建证书颁发机构",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "767cd82a8d4fde32",
      "translationZh": "在推出Universal SSL十二年后，Cloudflare宣布其意图成为公共证书颁发机构（CA），并为免费自动化证书颁发增加韧性。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2afc992aa319b4ee",
      "translationZh": "使用Merkle Tree Certificates构建后量子证书颁发机构",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80a61e2c4f6562c0",
      "translationZh": "我们计划中的CA将发放免费的Merkle Tree Certificates，旨在使后量子身份验证变得实用，而不对证书和握手造成大额成本。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2eba98bac54ca8b7",
      "translationZh": "利用AI规划我们后量子迁移的路线",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de86922d48a9c5fb",
      "translationZh": "CryptoLabe利用AI在我们的代码库中查找和分类密码学，而Cloudflare正努力在2029年前完成其后量子迁移。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7689c3a7082f20a9",
      "translationZh": "防止针对 IPsec 的量子降级攻击",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8884d84be0f72c11",
      "translationZh": "Cloudflare 帮助开发了一种 IETF 扩展，该扩展对完整的 IKEv2 传输进行身份验证，并防止攻击者降级后量子 IPsec 隧道。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c27e6dda1371b854",
      "translationZh": "您的域名是否在使用后量子加密？现在您可以亲自查看。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7bbc73626258ec8e",
      "translationZh": "HTTP Analytics、Log Explorer 和 Logpush 现在会显示请求是否协商了后量子密钥交换，为客户提供可检查和报告的证据。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35e334ea66aa1625",
      "translationZh": "使用 Cloudflare Application Profiles 强化正向安全。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8de6a309f2ea84df",
      "translationZh": "Application Profiles 会学习 HTTP 请求的预期结构，以便客户能够识别偏差并强制执行有效应用流量应呈现的形式。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33aca1f6945df668",
      "translationZh": "我们使用前沿 AI 模型测试了自己的 WAF。以下是我们的发现。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "322097a191fc2618",
      "translationZh": "自适应 AI 红队系统在六类攻击中发现了 WAF 检测漏洞，这有助于我们改进客户的规范化和托管规则。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd4aeff1e186c636",
      "translationZh": "推出 Threat Signals：面向开源威胁情报的智能体技能，对所有 Cloudflare 账户免费开放",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a7eb289c7a2aa6f",
      "translationZh": "Threat Signals 将开源报告转化为结构化指标，并将上下文关联到 WAF 规则，同时 Threat Events Platform 扩展至每个账户。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19bc8363c6ce2517",
      "translationZh": "面向 AI 时代的自适应应用安全：Cloudflare 如何连接代码、流量和情报以阻止攻击",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "abcfa675330e0cc1",
      "translationZh": "我们的应用安全框架将发现、治理、运行时保护、调查和响应连接在一个持续学习循环中。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c6d3b7caeb6907b6",
      "translationZh": "9 月 30 日，星期三——驱动智能体经济",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2223fc4b1db43694",
      "translationZh": "随着我们宣布 Pay Per Use 并以测试版形式推出 Monetization Gateway，我们分享了如何为一种新的经济模式构建支持，该模式赋能创作者对其内容和服务进行变现。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d59c7f04c32b074",
      "translationZh": "互联网有了第二受众",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c4957a76551ccb5",
      "translationZh": "AI 智能体请求快速增长，我们的策略帮助创作者查看智能体、设置访问条件，并在智能体使用其作品时获得报酬。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f1d9ee2f6ae0f416",
      "translationZh": "Cloudflare 容器，重构以扩展智能体沙箱",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5285f3b88ea274d0",
      "translationZh": "容器现在拥有更快的启动速度、灵活的镜像和实例选择、新的调度控制，以及用于持久化代理工作区的文件系统快照。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64be820378b64937",
      "translationZh": "变现网关测试版：通过 HTTP 402 向 AI 智能体收取消费费用",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f098fea72e38919",
      "translationZh": "Monetization Gateway 允许卖家为 Cloudflare 背后的资源定价，并使用 HTTP 402 和 x402 收集智能体支付。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef3a26e6306b1cf2",
      "translationZh": "按使用付费：当 AI 使用你的作品时，你应该获得报酬",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dcfe83ad396872ba",
      "translationZh": "按量付费功能会在经过验证的 AI 买家使用其内容时，为已注册的发布者提供使用报告、账单和付款。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c412f3c27f9ba46",
      "translationZh": "简化人类和智能体的领域",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c1064a1f4efbde6c",
      "translationZh": "全新的域名搜索体验和扩展的注册商 API 使个人和智能体都能更轻松地搜索、注册、转移和管理域名。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d392273fc0c4016",
      "translationZh": "通过用户洞察识别 AI 模型过度使用",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e251fe27cf2c3c5a",
      "translationZh": "AI Gateway 用户洞察功能可识别任务类型、模型适配度以及过度使用情况，帮助团队了解在哪些场景下可以使用更小或成本更低的模型。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1be5529f503b2bda",
      "translationZh": "检测生产问题并直接发送给您的智能体",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca1fef75f0feb560",
      "translationZh": "Issues 会收集 Workers 的错误，并将相关的堆栈跟踪、日志和追踪信息发送给编码代理或任意 Webhook，以便更快地进行调查。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d58469a7ea304621",
      "translationZh": "使用 AI Gateway 的自动路由器降低您的 AI 支出",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7d45102235ddda9d",
      "translationZh": "Auto Router 在边缘对每个请求进行分类，并将其发送到合适的模型，从而在保持响应质量的同时降低成本。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f05f2c99171d424",
      "translationZh": "Cloudflare Impact 的捐款总额达到 1 亿美元",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02d4af9704c80f42",
      "translationZh": "包括“Project Galileo”、“Athenian Project”和“Cloudflare for Campaigns”在内的举措，目前已提供了价值超过1亿美元的捐赠服务。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bc0f65d856ec6d0d",
      "translationZh": "10月1日星期四 - 将更多开发者栈功能引入 Cloudflare",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "141c38e625d666fb",
      "translationZh": "随着 Cloudflare Basin（我们的数据分析平台）正式可用、K2（一种持久化无服务器事件流）的推出，以及我们新竞赛的宣布——邀请开发者构建专为智能体开发设计的 Git 平台——我们扩展了在 Cloudflare 平台上可实现的功能范围。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48eb174fe443c46f",
      "translationZh": "推出 Cloudflare Basin：一个开放、无服务器的数据平台，现已正式可用",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76fc8379bf6d02c2",
      "translationZh": "Basin 现已正式可用，为开发者提供了一个基于 Apache Iceberg 和 R2 构建的无服务器平台，用于摄取、管理和查询大型数据集。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85c798629ed997cd",
      "translationZh": "Workers 对现代加密算法的支持",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    }
  ],
